      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$\\mathrm{O}^{2-}>\\mathrm{F}>\\mathrm{Na}^{+}>\\mathrm{Mg}^{2+}>\\mathrm{Al}^{3+}$",
      "is_correct": true
